From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Sat, 13 Sep 2026 16:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] sysbus: drop the hand-written manifest that collides with the generated one

webos_system_bus already generates g-camera-pipeline.manifest.json from
the files in this directory. This hand-written one declares the same
"id": "g-camera-pipeline" and the same "version": "1.0.0", so both land in
manifests.d claiming one id.

SecurityData::AddManifest() keeps a single manifest per id and drops the
rest. Which one survives is decided by g_dir_read_name() order, and the
hand-written copy is the poorer of the two: it omits groupsFiles, so when
it wins com.webos.pipeline.camera.groups.json never reaches ls-hubd at
all.

The generated manifest is a strict superset. Remove this one, and with it
the two references in files/CMakeLists.txt - the configure_file that reads
the template and the install() that would ship the result. Leaving those
behind fails do_configure outright:

    CMake Error: File .../files/sysbus/com.webos.pipeline.camera.manifest.json.in
                 does not exist.
    CMake Error at files/CMakeLists.txt:17 (configure_file):
      configure_file Problem configuring file

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
---
 files/CMakeLists.txt                                    |  3 ---
 files/sysbus/com.webos.pipeline.camera.manifest.json.in | 16 ----------------
 2 files changed, 19 deletions(-)

--- a/files/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/files/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -14,15 +14,12 @@
 #
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
 
-configure_file(sysbus/com.webos.pipeline.camera.manifest.json.in sysbus/com.webos.pipeline.camera.manifest.json @ONLY)
 configure_file(sysbus/com.webos.pipeline.camera.role.json.in sysbus/com.webos.pipeline.camera.role.json @ONLY)
 configure_file(sysbus/com.webos.pipeline.camera.service.in sysbus/com.webos.pipeline.camera.service @ONLY)
 configure_file(sysbus/com.webos.pipeline.camera.api.json sysbus/com.webos.pipeline.camera.api.json @ONLY)
 configure_file(sysbus/com.webos.pipeline.camera.perm.json sysbus/com.webos.pipeline.camera.perm.json @ONLY)
 configure_file(sysbus/com.webos.pipeline.camera.groups.json sysbus/com.webos.pipeline.camera.groups.json @ONLY)
 
-install(FILES ${CMAKE_CURRENT_BINARY_DIR}/sysbus/com.webos.pipeline.camera.manifest.json
-    DESTINATION /usr/share/luna-service2/manifests.d/)
 install(FILES ${CMAKE_CURRENT_BINARY_DIR}/sysbus/com.webos.pipeline.camera.role.json
     DESTINATION /usr/share/luna-service2/roles.d/)
 install(FILES ${CMAKE_CURRENT_BINARY_DIR}/sysbus/com.webos.pipeline.camera.service
--- a/files/sysbus/com.webos.pipeline.camera.manifest.json.in
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1,16 +0,0 @@
-{
-    "apiPermissionFiles": [
-        "/usr/share/luna-service2/api-permissions.d/com.webos.pipeline.camera.api.json"
-    ],
-    "roleFiles": [
-       "/usr/share/luna-service2/roles.d/com.webos.pipeline.camera.role.json"
-    ],
-    "id": "g-camera-pipeline",
-    "clientPermissionFiles": [
-        "/usr/share/luna-service2/client-permissions.d/com.webos.pipeline.camera.perm.json"
-    ],
-    "version": "1.0.0",
-    "serviceFiles": [
-        "/usr/share/luna-service2/services.d/com.webos.pipeline.camera.service"
-    ]
- }
